WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.450
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.720 --> 01:48.020
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.100 --> 01:51.000
[Episode 10]

4
01:51.310 --> 01:52.680
The promo video's about to play.

5
01:52.680 --> 01:53.620
Don't mess it up.

6
01:54.370 --> 01:55.180
Tingting.

7
01:55.930 --> 01:57.280
Sort out the products over here.

8
01:57.280 --> 01:58.340
Remember the set for the guests.

9
01:58.340 --> 01:59.009
Okay.

10
01:59.330 --> 02:00.550
Don't just wipe the outside!

11
02:00.550 --> 02:01.690
Clean the inside too.

12
02:01.690 --> 02:02.790
They're watching.

13
02:05.310 --> 02:06.480
Shoot well, Nana.

14
02:06.510 --> 02:07.310
Memory card's swapped out.

15
02:07.310 --> 02:08.080
Don't worry.

16
02:09.070 --> 02:09.880
Feifei!

17
02:12.960 --> 02:14.060
Why are you here?

18
02:14.580 --> 02:16.150
It's my bestie's big day.

19
02:16.170 --> 02:18.270
Of course I have to come and support you.

20
02:18.270 --> 02:18.990
Thank you.

21
02:19.020 --> 02:20.750
I'll find you a good seat later.

22
02:22.030 --> 02:24.680
This outfit looks so good on you.

23
02:24.680 --> 02:26.410
It really suits you.

24
02:31.310 --> 02:33.210
Isn't that Yun Li?

25
02:34.520 --> 02:35.520
Do you know her?

26
02:36.570 --> 02:37.070
Yeah.

27
02:37.090 --> 02:38.890
We were high school classmates.

28
02:40.860 --> 02:42.060
What a coincidence.

29
02:42.550 --> 02:44.210
She works at your company too?

30
02:44.970 --> 02:46.560
Just an intern.

31
02:47.110 --> 02:48.710
So she's your subordinate.

32
02:49.210 --> 02:50.540
What is she in charge of?

33
02:51.460 --> 02:53.000
What else could she be in charge of?

34
02:53.000 --> 02:55.130
Playing mascots, handing out flyers,

35
02:55.150 --> 02:56.210
and doing odd jobs.

36
02:56.970 --> 02:57.780
Yun Li

37
02:57.780 --> 02:59.310
is still the same as ever.

38
02:59.310 --> 03:01.750
Pretending to be so innocent,

39
03:02.060 --> 03:03.310
but she never takes initiative,

40
03:03.310 --> 03:04.120
nor does she say no.

41
03:04.120 --> 03:05.280
She's on good terms

42
03:05.280 --> 03:06.560
with all the boys.

43
03:07.060 --> 03:09.560
She seems a little two-faced.

44
03:10.910 --> 03:11.710
Right.

45
03:13.060 --> 03:14.680
She's still tangled up with

46
03:14.680 --> 03:15.910
a bunch of guys.

47
03:16.650 --> 03:17.910
That's just how she is.

48
03:18.460 --> 03:19.150
Look.

49
03:19.180 --> 03:20.840
She's not doing very well now.

50
03:20.870 --> 03:22.120
She's just a little intern

51
03:22.120 --> 03:23.450
who gets bossed around.

52
03:25.360 --> 03:27.079
Unlike you,

53
03:27.079 --> 03:29.280
who's already a publicity supervisor.

54
03:29.860 --> 03:30.910
You'll be a rich lady soon.

55
03:30.910 --> 03:32.280
Don't forget about me.

56
03:33.970 --> 03:35.680
No supervisors here,

57
03:35.680 --> 03:36.740
we're all the same.

58
03:36.910 --> 03:38.250
You're just being modest.

59
03:38.250 --> 03:39.020
Du Gefei.

60
03:40.430 --> 03:41.200
I've got work to do.

61
03:41.200 --> 03:42.460
Look around yourself.

62
03:43.280 --> 03:43.960
I've been looking for you.

63
03:43.960 --> 03:44.960
Why are you here?

64
03:45.470 --> 03:46.520
I'm sorry, Yuning.

65
03:46.520 --> 03:47.150
I...

66
03:47.310 --> 03:48.280
The guest for the interactive segment

67
03:48.280 --> 03:48.780
can't make it.

68
03:48.780 --> 03:50.310
We need a new segment to fill in.

69
03:50.310 --> 03:51.620
It needs to be interactive

70
03:51.620 --> 03:52.470
and entertaining.

71
03:52.470 --> 03:53.310
The subsequent agenda

72
03:53.310 --> 03:53.870
needs to be adjusted.

73
03:53.870 --> 03:55.470
I want to see it in 15 minutes.

74
03:55.900 --> 03:56.900
Fifteen minutes?

75
03:57.270 --> 03:59.000
Yes. We're running out of time.

76
03:59.140 --> 03:59.710
Right.

77
03:59.740 --> 04:01.470
The focus is on Light Chaser.

78
04:01.470 --> 04:02.750
The total promo duration stays the same,

79
04:02.750 --> 04:04.520
and there cannot be any dead air.

80
04:04.520 --> 04:05.310
But...

81
04:05.310 --> 04:06.210
But what?

82
04:06.860 --> 04:07.870
Unexpected issues at events

83
04:07.870 --> 04:08.910
are normal.

84
04:09.060 --> 04:10.390
Can you handle it or not?

85
04:11.520 --> 04:12.310
I can.

86
04:16.269 --> 04:17.800
How am I supposed to do this?

87
04:17.860 --> 04:18.870
Fifteen minutes.

88
04:25.360 --> 04:27.090
Drop what you're doing, Yun Li.

89
04:27.980 --> 04:28.860
Help me.

90
04:33.159 --> 04:34.570
Let's talk somewhere else.

91
04:34.570 --> 04:35.750
I'm busy right now.

92
04:37.200 --> 04:37.860
Wait.

93
04:40.680 --> 04:41.480
Wait.

94
04:41.920 --> 04:43.860
You said we need to rework the event plan.

95
04:43.860 --> 04:44.750
Don't even get me started.

96
04:44.750 --> 04:45.860
The guest for the interactive segment

97
04:45.860 --> 04:46.720
bailed at the last minute.

98
04:46.720 --> 04:48.560
The following segments are all canceled.

99
04:48.560 --> 04:49.960
Yuning wants us to figure out

100
04:49.960 --> 04:50.850
how to fix it.

101
04:52.250 --> 04:53.310
Us?

102
04:53.680 --> 04:54.720
Or just you?

103
04:55.980 --> 04:57.560
What's the difference?

104
04:58.360 --> 05:00.130
Yun Li, just help me.

105
05:00.560 --> 05:01.560
I'll treat you to dinner.

106
05:01.560 --> 05:02.270
Sorry.

107
05:02.270 --> 05:03.010
I still have to hand out flyers.

108
05:03.010 --> 05:03.980
Ask someone else.

109
05:03.980 --> 05:05.680
You know Light Chaser best.

110
05:05.710 --> 05:06.280
This concerns

111
05:06.280 --> 05:08.140
the whole publicity department.

112
05:08.950 --> 05:10.280
I'm very busy right now.

113
05:10.750 --> 05:11.560
Yun Li.

114
05:12.060 --> 05:13.070
This is your proposal.

115
05:13.070 --> 05:13.870
Now that something went wrong,

116
05:13.870 --> 05:15.730
you have to take responsibility.

117
05:15.870 --> 05:17.070
So now you admit this proposal

118
05:17.070 --> 05:17.950
was mine?

119
05:20.680 --> 05:21.360
But this has nothing to do

120
05:21.360 --> 05:22.510
with me anymore.

121
05:23.180 --> 05:25.180
You can't just leave me in the lurch.

122
05:26.360 --> 05:27.250
You must have

123
05:27.250 --> 05:28.560
a backup plan, right?

124
05:32.450 --> 05:33.250
Fine.

125
05:33.250 --> 05:35.110
Then we'll just go down together.

126
05:35.510 --> 05:36.810
If the event is ruined,

127
05:37.750 --> 05:38.900
I'll tell everyone

128
05:38.930 --> 05:40.520
that your proposal had problems

129
05:40.520 --> 05:42.180
and you refused to cooperate.

130
05:44.780 --> 05:45.580
Du Gefei.

131
05:46.530 --> 05:47.530
I can help you,

132
05:48.680 --> 05:50.810
but you have to agree to one condition.

133
05:50.980 --> 05:51.909
What condition?

134
05:53.750 --> 05:54.940
After the event,

135
05:54.970 --> 05:56.250
you must publicly admit

136
05:56.250 --> 05:58.510
that I was the one who made this proposal.

137
06:00.420 --> 06:01.480
If you don't agree,

138
06:02.370 --> 06:03.770
then handle it yourself.

139
06:03.990 --> 06:04.640
Anyway, right now,

140
06:04.640 --> 06:05.720
I'm just an errand girl.

141
06:05.720 --> 06:06.920
You are in charge of this event.

142
06:06.920 --> 06:08.720
Whoever is in charge takes the blame.

143
06:08.720 --> 06:09.950
Besides, you stole my proposal,

144
06:09.950 --> 06:11.810
and you still think you're right?

145
06:14.250 --> 06:15.060
Yun Li.

146
06:16.460 --> 06:17.570
I'm begging you.

147
06:19.480 --> 06:21.280
If we can't pull off this segment,

148
06:21.280 --> 06:22.780
we'll all lose face.

149
06:23.370 --> 06:24.720
Everyone has worked hard on Light Chaser

150
06:24.720 --> 06:25.720
for so long.

151
06:26.270 --> 06:28.530
We can't let it fall apart at the very end.

152
06:29.250 --> 06:31.420
Please, help me out,

153
06:32.650 --> 06:33.850
for everyone's sake.

154
06:37.040 --> 06:37.800
As long as you promise,

155
06:37.800 --> 06:38.930
after the event,

156
06:39.120 --> 06:40.060
you will admit

157
06:40.060 --> 06:41.620
that I made this proposal.

158
06:43.370 --> 06:44.360
I promise.

159
06:59.190 --> 06:59.870
Yuning.

160
06:59.870 --> 07:01.600
Have you seen the new proposal?

161
07:03.540 --> 07:04.500
Great.

162
07:05.950 --> 07:07.310
Thank you, Yuning.

163
07:10.310 --> 07:11.980
Only you would believe it.

164
07:12.660 --> 07:13.950
I won't admit it.

165
07:45.810 --> 07:47.190
Next up is the Light Chaser

166
07:47.190 --> 07:48.750
trivia quiz segment.

167
07:48.950 --> 07:51.250
The Light Chaser is set up with...

168
07:52.220 --> 07:54.159
The Light Chaser is equipped with advanced

169
07:54.159 --> 07:56.950
external sensors and millimeter...

170
07:57.390 --> 07:59.390
Millimeter-level precision...

171
07:59.720 --> 08:02.250
Millimeter-level precision base stations.

172
08:03.250 --> 08:04.480
What even is this gibberish?

173
08:04.480 --> 08:06.150
Who can memorize this?

174
08:10.160 --> 08:10.950
Shize.

175
08:11.090 --> 08:13.240
I'm preparing today's schedule.

176
08:16.210 --> 08:17.670
Did you write it yourself?

177
08:18.620 --> 08:19.510
Of course.

178
08:19.920 --> 08:21.560
I studied the Light Chaser

179
08:21.560 --> 08:22.560
very thoroughly.

180
08:23.360 --> 08:24.160
Really?

181
08:25.390 --> 08:26.600
If you had truly studied it

182
08:26.600 --> 08:27.360
thoroughly,

183
08:28.310 --> 08:29.220
you wouldn't have been

184
08:29.220 --> 08:31.480
chatting with someone privately there.

185
08:32.000 --> 08:33.360
I didn't.

186
08:33.929 --> 08:36.080
I've been memorizing the script here.

187
08:37.210 --> 08:39.870
Memorizing the script that Yun Li wrote for you?

188
08:43.600 --> 08:45.120
To ensure player safety,

189
08:45.750 --> 08:46.750
Light Chaser is equipped with

190
08:46.750 --> 08:48.750
a comprehensive monitoring system.

191
08:48.750 --> 08:49.740
Every corner,

192
08:50.150 --> 08:51.350
every conversation,

193
08:51.940 --> 08:53.600
is recorded crystal clear—

194
08:54.550 --> 08:55.340
including your little chat

195
08:55.340 --> 08:56.470
with Yun Li just now.

196
08:58.250 --> 08:59.780
What are you talking about?

197
08:59.840 --> 09:01.700
If you spent less time on scheming

198
09:01.750 --> 09:03.480
and just did your job honestly,

199
09:04.030 --> 09:04.650
you wouldn't have

200
09:04.650 --> 09:06.180
made such a stupid mistake.

201
09:08.100 --> 09:08.910
Du Gefei.

202
09:11.940 --> 09:13.470
I'm giving you two options.

203
09:14.100 --> 09:14.890
Either

204
09:15.050 --> 09:16.850
you honor your promise to Yun Li.

205
09:17.360 --> 09:18.150
At the celebration party,

206
09:18.150 --> 09:19.350
in front of everyone,

207
09:19.960 --> 09:21.410
confess everything you've done.

208
09:21.410 --> 09:22.700
And the other option?

209
09:24.700 --> 09:25.700
The other option

210
09:27.890 --> 09:28.820
is to let this video

211
09:28.820 --> 09:30.280
do the confessing for you.

212
09:31.250 --> 09:31.960
You should know

213
09:31.960 --> 09:33.290
which option

214
09:34.620 --> 09:35.890
is better for you.

215
09:50.720 --> 09:52.460
Thank you all for coming.

216
09:52.880 --> 09:53.900
The launch ceremony of our Light Chaser

217
09:53.900 --> 09:56.730
officially begins now.

218
10:01.390 --> 10:02.390
Distinguished guests,

219
10:02.390 --> 10:03.220
hello everyone.

220
10:03.220 --> 10:04.890
Welcome to the promotional event

221
10:04.890 --> 10:06.460
for EAW Light Chaser,

222
10:06.500 --> 10:08.000
Nanwu's first

223
10:08.000 --> 10:09.410
VR experience center.

224
10:09.410 --> 10:11.200
I'm your host, Du Gefei.

225
10:39.010 --> 10:39.820
Ice water.

226
10:45.000 --> 10:45.800
Thank you.

227
10:57.670 --> 10:58.480
What's wrong?

228
11:00.910 --> 11:01.740
Are you okay?

229
11:07.440 --> 11:08.410
About the proposal,

230
11:08.410 --> 11:10.140
I should've been more careful.

231
11:10.460 --> 11:12.520
I'll just take it as a lesson learned.

232
11:15.840 --> 11:17.870
But seeing the event go so smoothly,

233
11:18.840 --> 11:20.270
I feel a bit comforted.

234
11:23.900 --> 11:26.190
As long as she admits after the event

235
11:26.440 --> 11:28.340
that I made the proposal.

236
11:34.440 --> 11:35.240
Don't worry.

237
11:36.670 --> 11:37.480
She will.

238
11:40.840 --> 11:41.770
I hope so.

239
11:55.050 --> 11:56.740
This event was a big success.

240
11:57.240 --> 11:58.700
Everyone has worked hard.

241
11:59.250 --> 12:00.580
The company has decided

242
12:00.750 --> 12:02.750
to give every member of the publicity department

243
12:02.750 --> 12:03.840
a bonus

244
12:03.870 --> 12:04.930
as encouragement.

245
12:06.650 --> 12:08.440
Thank you, Boss!

246
12:10.440 --> 12:11.240
Great!

247
12:12.030 --> 12:13.190
Thank you, Boss!

248
12:13.750 --> 12:14.750
It's not a huge amount,

249
12:14.750 --> 12:15.650
but I hope everyone

250
12:15.650 --> 12:16.960
will continue to work hard

251
12:16.960 --> 12:18.200
and do your best

252
12:18.270 --> 12:19.220
in the future.

253
12:19.240 --> 12:19.770
Alright!

254
12:19.770 --> 12:21.150
No problem!

255
12:22.600 --> 12:23.550
Quiet down, everyone.

256
12:23.550 --> 12:25.010
I'd like to say a few words.

257
12:25.160 --> 12:25.860
I think

258
12:25.880 --> 12:27.440
there's someone we should thank today.

259
12:27.440 --> 12:29.150
Our hero of the day:

260
12:29.180 --> 12:29.970
Feifei!

261
12:30.150 --> 12:32.150
She did a great job today.

262
12:32.150 --> 12:34.000
I propose a toast to her.

263
12:34.000 --> 12:34.530
Great!

264
12:34.530 --> 12:34.860
Cheers!

265
12:34.860 --> 12:36.440
Cheers!

266
12:36.440 --> 12:38.440
Thanks to Feifei's great proposal,

267
12:38.460 --> 12:39.670
we all got to share

268
12:39.840 --> 12:40.790
the credit.

269
12:40.790 --> 12:41.390
Right?

270
12:41.390 --> 12:43.290
Yes, thanks to Feifei.

271
12:43.440 --> 12:44.240
Feifei.

272
12:44.640 --> 12:45.530
For the next good project,

273
12:45.530 --> 12:46.550
count me in.

274
12:47.120 --> 12:48.320
Not at all.

275
12:48.350 --> 12:49.360
You flatter me.

276
12:49.360 --> 12:49.860
This wasn't

277
12:49.860 --> 12:50.840
my doing alone.

278
12:50.840 --> 12:52.340
I also want to thank everyone for your cooperation.

279
12:52.340 --> 12:53.670
Here, a toast to you all.

280
12:53.960 --> 12:54.600
Come, Feifei.

281
12:54.600 --> 12:55.000
Come on.

282
12:55.000 --> 12:56.130
Cheers, everyone.

283
12:57.750 --> 12:58.880
Thank you, Ms. Fang.

284
12:59.100 --> 13:00.830
-Thank you, Mr. Xu. -Thank you.

285
13:04.840 --> 13:05.630
Du Gefei.

286
13:06.600 --> 13:08.200
Didn't we have an agreement?

287
13:09.440 --> 13:10.500
What agreement?

288
13:11.460 --> 13:13.500
I don't understand what you mean.

289
13:14.960 --> 13:16.460
I helped you revise your speech,

290
13:16.460 --> 13:16.950
and you...

291
13:16.950 --> 13:17.640
Yun Li.

292
13:18.600 --> 13:20.700
I wrote the speech myself.

293
13:21.250 --> 13:22.650
Are you feeling alright?

294
13:28.130 --> 13:28.940
Du Gefei.

295
13:29.860 --> 13:32.190
You have something else to say, don't you?

296
13:37.360 --> 13:38.820
Want me to jog your memory?

297
13:39.460 --> 13:41.460
If you don't want to say it yourself.

298
13:41.460 --> 13:42.520
I'll say it myself.

299
13:45.310 --> 13:46.500
My proposal...

300
13:48.250 --> 13:50.340
did reference Yun Li's work.

301
13:52.750 --> 13:54.130
How could she be this kind of person?

302
13:54.130 --> 13:55.460
I really couldn't tell.

303
13:58.460 --> 13:59.290
Exactly.

304
13:59.890 --> 14:00.940
I'm sorry, Yun Li.

305
14:01.980 --> 14:03.760
I shouldn't have taken your proposal

306
14:03.760 --> 14:05.090
and claimed it as my own.

307
14:13.480 --> 14:14.270
Du Gefei.

308
14:14.670 --> 14:15.910
You know very well

309
14:16.460 --> 14:18.360
that plagiarizing a proposal is a serious violation

310
14:18.360 --> 14:19.820
of company rules.

311
14:21.160 --> 14:22.210
Come to my office first thing tomorrow

312
14:22.210 --> 14:23.150
to explain yourself.

313
14:23.150 --> 14:24.460
HR will handle this

314
14:24.460 --> 14:25.440
strictly according to regulations.

315
14:25.440 --> 14:26.180
Ms. Fang.

316
14:26.460 --> 14:28.220
Today is a happy day.

317
14:28.250 --> 14:30.250
How about we talk about it tomorrow?

318
14:30.420 --> 14:31.470
Young people

319
14:31.980 --> 14:33.250
inevitably make mistakes.

320
14:33.250 --> 14:33.960
Right?

321
14:34.740 --> 14:35.530
Feifei.

322
14:36.440 --> 14:38.130
Hurry back and write a report

323
14:38.600 --> 14:40.060
to explain the situation.

324
14:40.240 --> 14:41.480
Yes... yes, Ms. Fang.

325
14:42.170 --> 14:44.240
I really know I was wrong.

326
14:51.650 --> 14:52.370
Alright.

327
14:53.180 --> 14:54.150
I will

328
14:54.180 --> 14:55.270
get to the bottom of this

329
14:55.270 --> 14:56.530
after the celebration dinner.

330
14:56.530 --> 14:57.630
I will definitely give everyone

331
14:57.630 --> 14:59.170
a fair and just answer.

332
15:03.390 --> 15:04.840
Thank you for today.

333
15:06.050 --> 15:06.980
You're welcome.

334
15:08.130 --> 15:08.940
I don't want this

335
15:08.940 --> 15:10.270
to happen again either.

336
15:12.390 --> 15:14.050
A new segment was added today.

337
15:14.390 --> 15:16.030
Du Gefei promised to admit

338
15:16.230 --> 15:18.360
she plagiarized my proposal after the event,

339
15:18.360 --> 15:19.760
just to get me to help her.

340
15:20.790 --> 15:21.650
I didn't expect her

341
15:21.650 --> 15:23.380
to go back on her word in the end.

342
15:23.870 --> 15:25.270
But I'm curious,

343
15:26.000 --> 15:27.840
how did you get her to admit it?

344
15:31.000 --> 15:32.460
Because she's too stupid.

345
15:36.630 --> 15:38.440
Then why did you help me?

346
15:41.250 --> 15:42.510
Because you needed it.

347
15:45.350 --> 15:46.140
Then,

348
15:46.910 --> 15:48.240
if it were someone else,

349
15:48.390 --> 15:49.720
would you help them too?

350
15:49.890 --> 15:50.700
No.

351
15:55.120 --> 15:56.300
Have you

352
15:57.080 --> 15:59.150
ever liked anyone before?

353
16:03.860 --> 16:05.340
Just asking casually.

354
16:05.340 --> 16:06.540
-If you don't… -I did.

355
16:11.260 --> 16:12.060
I once

356
16:14.100 --> 16:14.860
met a

357
16:14.860 --> 16:16.100
very special girl.

358
16:19.890 --> 16:22.390
Did you two end up together?

359
16:30.290 --> 16:33.100
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

360
16:33.970 --> 16:36.620
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

361
16:37.310 --> 16:39.720
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

362
16:39.740 --> 16:42.940
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

363
16:43.850 --> 16:46.940
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

364
16:47.430 --> 16:49.590
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

365
16:49.860 --> 16:52.900
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

366
16:53.530 --> 16:56.830
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

367
16:58.470 --> 17:01.400
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

368
17:01.420 --> 17:03.580
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

369
17:05.450 --> 17:08.400
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

370
17:08.430 --> 17:10.720
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

371
17:11.800 --> 17:15.369
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

372
17:15.540 --> 17:18.400
♪ To meet the moon ♪

373
17:18.420 --> 17:21.349
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

374
17:21.380 --> 17:24.270
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

375
17:24.290 --> 17:28.450
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

376
17:28.780 --> 17:31.650
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

377
17:31.760 --> 17:35.500
♪ Love gives us all ♪

378
17:35.520 --> 17:38.580
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

379
17:37.530 --> 17:38.330
No.

380
17:38.600 --> 17:39.420
♪ You know ♪

381
17:39.440 --> 17:40.210
Later...

382
17:39.440 --> 17:42.680
♪ I want to fall in love with you ♪

383
17:41.440 --> 17:42.640
I never saw her again.

384
17:42.700 --> 17:45.510
♪ No matter how many times I say I love you ♪

385
17:45.530 --> 17:49.110
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

386
17:45.680 --> 17:47.680
So he has liked someone else before.

387
17:50.000 --> 17:54.900
♪ I could say it ten thousand times and never tire ♪

388
17:56.980 --> 17:58.070
But it's okay.

389
17:58.380 --> 18:00.250
On my journey of chasing the moon,

390
18:00.480 --> 18:03.080
the moonlight has been shining on me all along.

391
18:22.180 --> 18:23.440
Why isn't she here yet?

392
18:24.660 --> 18:25.400
Yun Ye.

393
18:26.900 --> 18:27.440
Yunyi.

394
18:28.530 --> 18:29.330
Yunyi, look.

395
18:30.290 --> 18:31.110
Exam results are out.

396
18:31.110 --> 18:32.290
Really? How did you do?

397
18:32.290 --> 18:33.700
I did better than last time.

398
18:33.700 --> 18:34.590
You can't go back on

399
18:34.590 --> 18:35.790
what you promised me.

400
18:36.110 --> 18:37.380
Not bad.

401
18:37.750 --> 18:38.480
Of course.

402
18:39.990 --> 18:40.660
Bye.

403
18:55.580 --> 18:57.510
Who was that boy just now?

404
18:59.110 --> 18:59.920
A classmate.

405
19:00.720 --> 19:01.830
Just a classmate?

406
19:04.530 --> 19:05.940
You're still in school.

407
19:06.330 --> 19:08.190
You should focus on your studies.

408
19:09.330 --> 19:10.640
Anything that distracts you

409
19:10.640 --> 19:12.110
will affect your grades.

410
19:12.380 --> 19:14.040
You've always been obedient.

411
19:15.420 --> 19:17.020
You understand that, right?

412
19:24.330 --> 19:26.610
A separately excited DC motor

413
19:26.610 --> 19:28.920
is running with a constant torque load.

414
19:29.070 --> 19:30.270
If other conditions are stable,

415
19:30.270 --> 19:32.470
only reducing the armature voltage...

416
19:42.480 --> 19:44.010
Why the long face?

417
19:44.030 --> 19:44.980
Is it that hard?

418
19:47.050 --> 19:47.860
Let me see.

419
19:47.880 --> 19:49.490
What's got you so stumped?

420
19:52.480 --> 19:53.270
Forget it.

421
19:53.720 --> 19:55.320
I don't understand it at all.

422
19:57.310 --> 19:58.720
I'm jealous of you.

423
19:58.720 --> 19:59.680
You don't even need to study

424
19:59.680 --> 20:00.940
for Hotel Management.

425
20:01.380 --> 20:02.920
Well, I don't have to study,

426
20:03.040 --> 20:04.770
but we do have to complete an internship.

427
20:04.770 --> 20:06.630
Have you decided where to intern?

428
20:06.850 --> 20:07.650
Not yet.

429
20:08.240 --> 20:09.770
But I'd prefer

430
20:09.980 --> 20:10.980
somewhere smaller,

431
20:10.980 --> 20:12.330
with less foot traffic.

432
20:13.030 --> 20:14.110
No rush.

433
20:14.180 --> 20:15.040
Take your time.

434
20:17.370 --> 20:18.670
I'm in a rush.

435
20:19.140 --> 20:20.420
Then what should we do?

436
20:20.740 --> 20:23.070
If you don't know how, I definitely don't.

437
20:25.180 --> 20:26.770
Your boyfriend would know.

438
20:26.770 --> 20:27.570
Where is he?

439
20:27.640 --> 20:28.420
What boyfriend?

440
20:28.420 --> 20:29.350
I don't have one.

441
20:33.240 --> 20:35.650
We're not at that stage yet.

442
20:36.350 --> 20:37.960
Not at that stage?

443
20:38.140 --> 20:39.940
You've already kissed and held hands.

444
20:39.940 --> 20:41.940
If he's not your boyfriend, then...

445
20:42.930 --> 20:46.100
We're still taking things slow.

446
20:49.980 --> 20:51.030
Lately I've been feeling

447
20:51.030 --> 20:53.520
like he's hot and cold with me.

448
20:55.240 --> 20:56.440
Hot and cold?

449
20:56.640 --> 20:57.530
I... I don't know.

450
20:57.530 --> 20:59.880
It's just a feeling.

451
21:00.510 --> 21:02.740
You two just haven't spent enough time together.

452
21:02.740 --> 21:04.270
He hasn't gotten the chance to know you.

453
21:04.270 --> 21:06.180
And you haven't gotten to know him either.

454
21:06.180 --> 21:08.010
How are you supposed to take things further?

455
21:08.010 --> 21:09.610
But I've already tried my best.

456
21:09.610 --> 21:11.380
I can't just cling to him every day.

457
21:11.380 --> 21:12.700
Why not?

458
21:12.960 --> 21:14.550
Aren't exams coming up soon?

459
21:14.550 --> 21:15.810
Ask him out to study.

460
21:16.270 --> 21:19.160
Find a quiet café.

461
21:19.550 --> 21:21.750
You look at the book, and he looks at you.

462
21:22.010 --> 21:23.480
The sunlight outside the window

463
21:23.480 --> 21:25.810
spills over your focused faces.

464
21:29.960 --> 21:31.010
Study mode.

465
21:37.010 --> 21:37.880
I'm leaving, Luo.

466
21:37.880 --> 21:38.850
Take care, Yun Ye.

467
21:38.850 --> 21:39.500
Okay.

468
21:40.270 --> 21:41.000
Yun Ye.

469
21:41.200 --> 21:42.090
Yunyi.

470
21:42.420 --> 21:43.350
Why are you here?

471
21:44.250 --> 21:45.110
This is for you.

472
21:48.700 --> 21:49.510
This is...

473
21:50.050 --> 21:51.850
Didn't I promise you before

474
21:51.940 --> 21:53.030
that if you did well on your exams,

475
21:53.030 --> 21:54.360
I'd give you a reward?

476
21:56.790 --> 21:58.190
Did you fold all of these?

477
22:02.680 --> 22:03.740
They're so pretty.

478
22:05.810 --> 22:07.670
Why are you giving me paper stars?

479
22:08.010 --> 22:10.030
I read a sci-fi novel once.

480
22:10.350 --> 22:11.460
The people in it

481
22:11.480 --> 22:13.280
could buy distant stars

482
22:13.460 --> 22:15.520
and give them to whoever they wanted.

483
22:17.310 --> 22:19.420
I can't buy real stars for you,

484
22:19.790 --> 22:21.000
but I can make these

485
22:21.000 --> 22:21.790
for you.

486
22:22.500 --> 22:23.590
Each one

487
22:23.590 --> 22:24.720
is a different color.

488
22:24.720 --> 22:27.520
Just like the universe has red giants,

489
22:27.720 --> 22:29.550
white dwarfs, and black dwarfs.

490
22:29.610 --> 22:30.420
Every star

491
22:30.420 --> 22:32.000
shines with its own light.

492
22:33.810 --> 22:35.050
So romantic.

493
22:35.900 --> 22:37.180
Thank you, Yunyi.

494
22:37.850 --> 22:39.240
You folded so many.

495
22:39.240 --> 22:40.900
It must have taken a long time.

496
22:41.050 --> 22:42.910
I will definitely treasure them.

497
22:44.640 --> 22:45.450
Wait a moment.

498
22:50.460 --> 22:51.320
This is for you.

499
22:52.430 --> 22:53.330
This is...

500
22:54.000 --> 22:54.810
A telescope.

501
23:00.850 --> 23:02.170
I can't afford

502
23:02.200 --> 23:04.200
a high‑power astronomical telescope yet,

503
23:04.200 --> 23:05.660
but with this one,

504
23:05.850 --> 23:06.830
you can get a little closer

505
23:06.830 --> 23:07.700
to the stars.

506
23:10.920 --> 23:12.000
Thank you, Yun Ye.

507
23:12.960 --> 23:13.810
Take a look.

508
23:16.250 --> 23:17.450
Can you see anything?

509
23:18.220 --> 23:19.110
Yes.

510
23:40.350 --> 23:41.870
Still not right.

511
23:45.240 --> 23:45.940
Lili.

512
23:47.710 --> 23:48.510
Studying?

513
23:53.180 --> 23:53.830
Good luck.

514
23:53.830 --> 23:55.050
I'm going to take a shower.

515
23:55.050 --> 23:55.780
Fu Zhengchu.

516
23:59.830 --> 24:00.640
Um...

517
24:01.770 --> 24:04.190
If I paid

518
24:04.590 --> 24:06.680
to get your uncle to tutor me,

519
24:07.330 --> 24:08.590
would he agree to that?

520
24:09.500 --> 24:10.250
Lili,

521
24:10.250 --> 24:11.050
if you have questions,

522
24:11.050 --> 24:12.350
just ask my uncle directly.

523
24:12.350 --> 24:13.660
He won't charge you.

524
24:14.460 --> 24:15.750
No, I mean...

525
24:16.990 --> 24:19.860
do you have exams coming up?

526
24:20.160 --> 24:21.550
Yeah, I've got two.

527
24:22.460 --> 24:25.940
How's your studying going?

528
24:26.030 --> 24:27.900
Not bad.

529
24:28.290 --> 24:29.940
Not bad?

530
24:33.200 --> 24:34.090
Definitely not good.

531
24:34.090 --> 24:35.440
I'm about to fail my classes.

532
24:35.440 --> 24:36.350
If my uncle doesn't come

533
24:36.350 --> 24:37.000
save me,

534
24:37.000 --> 24:37.850
I'm doomed.

535
24:40.200 --> 24:40.810
Lili,

536
24:40.840 --> 24:42.370
how's your studying going?

537
24:42.430 --> 24:43.200
How about I invite my uncle,

538
24:43.200 --> 24:44.660
and we all study together?

539
24:45.250 --> 24:45.980
Okay.

540
24:48.350 --> 24:49.010
Great.

541
24:52.190 --> 24:53.820
Good luck, Auntie.

542
25:24.960 --> 25:26.160
Where's Fu Zhengchu?

543
25:26.370 --> 25:28.440
He said he'd be here a bit later.

544
25:32.250 --> 25:33.050
What's wrong?

545
25:33.240 --> 25:34.090
Nothing.

546
25:34.700 --> 25:37.030
You just look quite young today.

547
25:39.330 --> 25:41.440
Maybe I'm not that old to begin with.

548
25:41.710 --> 25:42.510
Right.

549
25:52.030 --> 25:52.830
Hello.

550
25:54.240 --> 25:55.100
One Americano.

551
25:58.160 --> 25:59.090
Matcha cake.

552
25:59.090 --> 25:59.790
Thank you.

553
26:04.900 --> 26:06.500
Do you have past exam papers?

554
26:06.940 --> 26:07.740
Yes.

555
26:07.780 --> 26:09.040
I have digital copies.

556
26:15.240 --> 26:16.830
You can pay attention to this question.

557
26:16.830 --> 26:18.330
Many calculus exam questions

558
26:18.330 --> 26:20.060
are transformed on this basis.

559
26:20.700 --> 26:21.960
First, we can determine

560
26:21.960 --> 26:24.160
this is a 0/0 indeterminate form limit.

561
26:24.660 --> 26:26.060
Apply L'Hôpital's rule.

562
26:26.530 --> 26:27.660
In the deleted neighborhood of the value

563
26:27.660 --> 26:29.350
that the variable approaches,

564
26:29.350 --> 26:31.140
both the numerator and denominator are differentiable.

565
26:31.140 --> 26:32.050
After differentiating the numerator and denominator

566
26:32.050 --> 26:33.200
respectively,

567
26:33.460 --> 26:34.250
we can get...

568
26:40.140 --> 26:41.400
Am I going too fast?

569
26:42.680 --> 26:43.480
No.

570
26:44.560 --> 26:45.820
Let me take some notes.

571
26:45.920 --> 26:47.130
And this question.

572
26:49.340 --> 26:50.340
Here's your cake,

573
26:53.510 --> 26:54.440
and your coffee.

574
26:55.030 --> 26:55.960
Hello, sir.

575
26:56.140 --> 26:57.790
Can I add you on WeChat?

576
26:59.050 --> 27:00.790
Sorry, I don't use WeChat.

577
27:02.880 --> 27:04.030
Don't feel too bad.

578
27:04.250 --> 27:05.550
I asked him for it before,

579
27:05.550 --> 27:07.410
but he didn't give it to me either.

580
27:08.030 --> 27:09.250
But we are sitting together now,

581
27:09.250 --> 27:11.000
and he is even explaining questions to me.

582
27:11.000 --> 27:12.590
Sorry to bother you.

583
27:18.570 --> 27:20.740
Why did what I just said

584
27:20.940 --> 27:23.180
sound like I was staking my claim?

585
27:23.750 --> 27:25.150
You still remember that?

586
27:27.740 --> 27:28.930
Not exactly.

587
27:28.960 --> 27:29.920
It's just...

588
27:30.700 --> 27:32.000
anything is possible.

589
27:35.030 --> 27:36.290
Anything is possible.

590
27:37.830 --> 27:39.050
We've known each other

591
27:39.050 --> 27:41.000
for a while now,

592
27:41.140 --> 27:42.540
so I guess we're friends.

593
27:43.030 --> 27:44.640
And friends can help each other

594
27:44.640 --> 27:45.790
find dates.

595
27:48.750 --> 27:49.810
What kind of dates?

596
27:56.090 --> 27:57.420
Someone good‑looking,

597
27:57.640 --> 27:58.590
quiet,

598
27:59.610 --> 28:01.200
shy around strangers,

599
28:01.570 --> 28:02.600
but open around you,

600
28:02.600 --> 28:04.400
and always orbiting around you.

601
28:04.400 --> 28:05.880
What do you think?

602
28:19.640 --> 28:20.900
Look at this question.

603
28:21.240 --> 28:22.500
This one's important.

604
28:45.840 --> 28:46.640
Lili,

605
28:46.920 --> 28:48.450
do I still need to come over?

606
28:52.220 --> 28:53.180
Why not?

607
28:56.680 --> 28:58.900
I just didn't want to be a third wheel.

608
29:00.920 --> 29:01.740
Fu Zhengchu.

609
29:05.110 --> 29:05.910
Tell him

610
29:06.250 --> 29:07.310
if he doesn't come,

611
29:07.440 --> 29:09.640
he'll have to do his homework on his own.

612
29:16.870 --> 29:18.130
Come over quickly.

613
29:29.550 --> 29:30.350
Focus.

614
29:35.720 --> 29:36.370
Uncle,

615
29:36.400 --> 29:37.850
don't look at me like that.

616
29:37.850 --> 29:40.640
I'm thinking through the problem.

617
29:41.180 --> 29:41.550
Right.

618
29:41.550 --> 29:42.290
Staring at me like that

619
29:42.290 --> 29:43.150
will affect me.

620
29:54.860 --> 29:56.720
Don't look at me like that either.

621
29:56.830 --> 29:58.890
I feel like I'm in elementary school.

622
30:03.360 --> 30:04.070
All right.

623
30:05.220 --> 30:05.680
Here.

624
30:12.660 --> 30:14.500
Well, very good.

625
30:17.350 --> 30:18.350
Nice work, Lili.

626
30:19.330 --> 30:20.140
Uncle,

627
30:20.290 --> 30:21.400
could you take a look at

628
30:21.400 --> 30:22.460
this question too?

629
30:22.740 --> 30:23.530
Here.

630
30:25.400 --> 30:26.860
Kirchhoff's Current Law.

631
30:27.420 --> 30:28.700
Then this current value...

632
30:28.700 --> 30:30.090
The current flowing into this node

633
30:30.090 --> 30:31.030
equals the current

634
30:31.030 --> 30:32.030
flowing out of it.

635
30:32.030 --> 30:34.160
That makes this problem easy to solve.

636
30:35.610 --> 30:36.720
I see.

637
30:39.240 --> 30:40.530
If only you two were

638
30:40.530 --> 30:41.250
my parents,

639
30:41.250 --> 30:42.090
then I wouldn't be

640
30:42.090 --> 30:43.290
such a study slacker.

641
30:43.690 --> 30:45.350
It mainly depends on your dad.

642
30:54.400 --> 30:56.320
I-I-I'm going to the restroom.

643
31:08.960 --> 31:10.590
So awkward.

644
31:10.610 --> 31:12.290
Yun Li, why did you chime in?

645
31:22.940 --> 31:24.140
What a coincidence.

646
31:24.390 --> 31:25.870
We meet again.

647
31:28.730 --> 31:29.860
May I ask who you are?

648
31:30.310 --> 31:32.390
I'm Yun Li's high school classmate.

649
31:33.310 --> 31:34.440
Just... last time,

650
31:34.560 --> 31:35.800
I ran into you guys

651
31:35.830 --> 31:37.080
at the vintage market.

652
31:37.080 --> 31:38.270
Don't you remember?

653
31:39.160 --> 31:40.510
Lili went to the restroom.

654
31:40.510 --> 31:41.180
How about this?

655
31:41.180 --> 31:42.810
Let me get you a drink,

656
31:42.880 --> 31:43.920
on Lili's behalf.

657
31:45.000 --> 31:45.810
Sure.

658
31:46.070 --> 31:47.010
Thank you.

659
31:47.430 --> 31:48.360
This seat...

660
31:53.220 --> 31:55.570
I was waiting for a friend over there.

661
31:55.710 --> 31:57.750
I saw Yun Li chatting with you.

662
31:57.920 --> 32:00.070
I feel she's much more cheerful now.

663
32:00.310 --> 32:02.050
I'm quite happy for her.

664
32:04.600 --> 32:06.260
I was in a hurry last time,

665
32:06.290 --> 32:07.550
so we didn't talk much.

666
32:07.680 --> 32:09.110
I'd actually love to hear

667
32:09.110 --> 32:10.480
how Yun Li's doing these days.

668
32:10.480 --> 32:12.540
How about we add each other on WeChat?

669
32:15.050 --> 32:17.660
How about you add mine?

670
32:18.670 --> 32:19.460
Sure.

671
32:19.680 --> 32:20.940
I'll scan your QR code.

672
32:22.070 --> 32:22.700
No need.

673
32:25.390 --> 32:26.660
How about

674
32:27.030 --> 32:28.260
you talk to Lili instead?

675
32:28.260 --> 32:30.920
It's been a while since you two caught up, right?

676
32:31.540 --> 32:32.370
Yeah.

677
32:32.400 --> 32:33.770
We haven't been in touch

678
32:33.770 --> 32:35.530
since we graduated high school.

679
32:35.530 --> 32:37.140
But in high school,

680
32:37.140 --> 32:39.070
we were very close.

681
32:39.970 --> 32:41.790
Though Yun Li

682
32:41.880 --> 32:44.440
mostly hung out with guys.

683
32:44.770 --> 32:46.510
I was her only female friend.

684
32:51.050 --> 32:52.110
Speaking of which,

685
32:52.510 --> 32:54.240
Yun Li was quite pitiful

686
32:54.240 --> 32:55.720
in high school.

687
32:57.110 --> 32:58.570
Isn't she deaf

688
32:58.570 --> 32:59.640
in one ear?

689
33:01.160 --> 33:02.010
Lili...

690
33:04.960 --> 33:05.770
Yeah.

691
33:06.380 --> 33:07.270
During class,

692
33:07.270 --> 33:08.830
she couldn't hear the teacher clearly

693
33:08.830 --> 33:10.860
and was often made to stand.

694
33:13.220 --> 33:16.340
Later, I heard she didn't get the postgraduate recommendation.

695
33:16.340 --> 33:17.170
Probably because

696
33:17.170 --> 33:18.900
she couldn't hear the teacher.

697
33:19.180 --> 33:21.680
But that wasn't even her fault.

698
33:22.040 --> 33:24.290
She's had trouble hearing since childhood

699
33:24.290 --> 33:25.960
and was often discriminated against

700
33:25.960 --> 33:28.200
because of it.

701
33:29.000 --> 33:31.160
We gradually lost touch after that.

702
33:32.290 --> 33:33.650
But seeing her

703
33:33.680 --> 33:35.680
so happy with you guys,

704
33:36.660 --> 33:38.110
I'm quite relieved.

705
33:38.590 --> 33:40.440
You said you graduated with your bachelor's

706
33:40.440 --> 33:41.570
and are working now?

707
33:41.640 --> 33:42.400
Yes.

708
33:42.400 --> 33:43.180
I'm currently at...

709
33:43.180 --> 33:45.310
Since you spoke ill of Yun Li last time,

710
33:45.440 --> 33:46.840
I've been very confused.

711
33:47.660 --> 33:49.860
You don't seem like an educated person.

712
33:50.900 --> 33:51.570
No,

713
33:51.570 --> 33:52.380
I was just hoping...

714
33:52.380 --> 33:54.180
Hoping we'd discover her flaws,

715
33:54.570 --> 33:55.070
right?

716
33:56.550 --> 33:57.750
I haven't found hers.

717
33:58.550 --> 34:00.010
Yours are pretty obvious.

718
34:09.210 --> 34:10.150
Yun Li.

719
34:11.010 --> 34:11.870
She's leaving.

720
34:19.360 --> 34:20.820
Then I'll walk her out.

721
34:40.000 --> 34:41.270
Y-Yun Li.

722
34:42.540 --> 34:43.389
I... I didn't

723
34:43.420 --> 34:45.230
want to bring this up,

724
34:45.230 --> 34:46.030
but

725
34:46.230 --> 34:47.300
your friends

726
34:47.420 --> 34:49.170
didn't seem to welcome me.

727
34:49.210 --> 34:50.170
What do you mean?

728
34:51.429 --> 34:53.409
I just chatted with them for a bit.

729
34:54.330 --> 34:55.530
Your friend has quite a temper,

730
34:55.530 --> 34:56.920
doesn't he?

731
35:00.510 --> 35:01.780
He has a temper?

732
35:04.320 --> 35:05.280
What did you say?

733
35:05.530 --> 35:07.230
I didn't say much.

734
35:07.880 --> 35:10.740
We just talked about you being made to stand before.

735
35:11.280 --> 35:11.800
I thought...

736
35:11.800 --> 35:12.630
You told them about

737
35:12.630 --> 35:13.690
my deaf left ear?

738
35:15.340 --> 35:16.010
I didn't expect

739
35:16.010 --> 35:17.340
that they didn't know.

740
35:17.820 --> 35:18.920
Besides,

741
35:18.920 --> 35:20.530
we've been classmates for so many years.

742
35:20.530 --> 35:21.320
I just wanted them

743
35:21.320 --> 35:22.230
to treat you better.

744
35:22.230 --> 35:22.780
I don't think

745
35:22.780 --> 35:23.940
telling my friends about my past embarrassments

746
35:23.940 --> 35:25.670
is a good thing.

747
35:26.730 --> 35:27.630
Qu Mingxin.

748
35:27.780 --> 35:28.420
I really treated you

749
35:28.420 --> 35:29.950
as a good friend in the past.

750
35:30.570 --> 35:31.420
When you approached me

751
35:31.420 --> 35:32.230
and wanted to be my friend,

752
35:32.230 --> 35:33.380
I was very grateful.

753
35:34.880 --> 35:35.780
But I never expected

754
35:35.780 --> 35:37.340
that you led everyone to ostracize me.

755
35:37.340 --> 35:38.280
I was too young

756
35:38.280 --> 35:39.210
to stand up to you.

757
35:39.210 --> 35:40.570
I thought if I endured it, it would pass.

758
35:40.570 --> 35:42.370
But that's not how it turned out.

759
35:46.730 --> 35:47.480
Uncle.

760
35:47.840 --> 35:49.900
You were angry just now, weren't you?

761
35:50.980 --> 35:51.780
No.

762
35:52.900 --> 35:55.030
Actually, I never noticed

763
35:55.030 --> 35:56.670
that Lili has

764
35:56.670 --> 35:57.480
a deaf ear.

765
36:02.940 --> 36:04.420
Did you know it all along?

766
36:04.780 --> 36:05.940
No wonder every time we go out,

767
36:05.940 --> 36:07.390
you're always on her right side.

768
36:07.390 --> 36:08.500
Just like now.

769
36:12.820 --> 36:13.280
You...

770
36:23.990 --> 36:25.390
Your book's upside down.

771
36:28.320 --> 36:28.880
Here.

772
36:30.840 --> 36:31.970
Complete this test.

773
36:46.630 --> 36:47.280
Hello?

774
36:47.300 --> 36:48.110
Tang Lin.

775
36:48.440 --> 36:49.910
Yes, I'm studying.

776
36:51.840 --> 36:52.780
Do I have to come?

777
36:53.810 --> 36:55.100
Alright, I got it.

778
36:55.420 --> 36:56.920
I really can't do anything about you.

779
36:56.920 --> 36:57.710
Tangy?

780
36:58.880 --> 37:00.710
Something came up. I have to go.

781
37:00.710 --> 37:01.610
Keep studying, you two.

782
37:01.610 --> 37:02.610
I'm leaving. Bye.

783
37:02.940 --> 37:03.670
Fu Zhengchu.

784
37:04.280 --> 37:04.840
You...

785
37:06.760 --> 37:07.300
Bye.

786
37:10.880 --> 37:12.210
Let's do the test paper.

787
37:26.170 --> 37:27.170
This question...

788
37:41.160 --> 37:43.810
♪ Who is it by my ear ♪

789
37:43.840 --> 37:47.310
♪ Casting shouts into the dark night ♪

790
37:48.030 --> 37:52.810
♪ Filling every crack in the clouds ♪

791
37:54.440 --> 37:57.070
♪ Echoes folding into paper boats ♪

792
37:57.100 --> 38:00.630
♪ Drifting down the river, around the shallows ♪

793
37:57.130 --> 37:58.590
You got angry at Qu Mingxin

794
37:58.610 --> 38:00.710
because of me, right?

795
38:01.090 --> 38:06.320
♪ Heading your way, with no turning back ♪

796
38:04.110 --> 38:07.630
It's the first time I've heard someone say you have a bad temper.

797
38:07.630 --> 38:10.350
♪ Burying regrets deep in the soil ♪

798
38:10.370 --> 38:13.530
♪ Waiting for a meeting to light up the loneliness ♪

799
38:10.780 --> 38:11.880
What do you look like

800
38:11.880 --> 38:13.110
when you're angry?

801
38:13.670 --> 38:15.300
♪ Moonlight gently sways ♪

802
38:15.330 --> 38:17.050
♪ Stars fall upon my shoulder ♪

803
38:15.730 --> 38:16.880
I've never seen it.

804
38:16.880 --> 38:17.940
What a pity.

805
38:17.080 --> 38:19.800
♪ Look at me ♪

806
38:19.830 --> 38:24.500
♪ The long night slows down ♪

807
38:24.990 --> 38:26.970
♪ The wounds kissed by the wind ♪

808
38:27.000 --> 38:28.390
♪ I remember them all ♪

809
38:28.420 --> 38:31.570
♪ Grains of sand count the depth of every fall ♪

810
38:31.600 --> 38:33.900
♪ Still fearing the collision ♪

811
38:33.920 --> 38:37.170
♪ Like a scorching heat on a cosmic scale ♪

812
38:37.010 --> 38:38.000
Fu Shize,

813
38:38.260 --> 38:40.230
are you pretending to be asleep?

814
38:38.340 --> 38:40.230
♪ Dreams folded by the rain ♪

815
38:40.260 --> 38:41.590
♪ Still crystal clear ♪

816
38:41.610 --> 38:44.850
♪ Clouds stitching up the colors of every break ♪

817
38:44.870 --> 38:47.200
♪ Borrowing a beam of moonlight ♪

818
38:47.360 --> 38:50.370
♪ To smooth over the uneasy past ♪

819
38:50.390 --> 38:57.640
♪ Picking up scattered light at my fingertips with you ♪

820
38:57.980 --> 38:58.940
Sorry, Mingxin.

821
38:58.940 --> 39:00.030
Something came up.

822
39:01.340 --> 39:02.540
You've already left?

823
39:03.780 --> 39:05.310
Let's meet up another time.

824
39:40.610 --> 39:42.010
-Yuan. -Don't come over.

825
39:43.170 --> 39:43.920
Shize.

826
39:44.950 --> 39:46.610
Why did I ever have to meet you?

827
39:52.820 --> 39:53.530
Yuan!

828
39:56.000 --> 39:56.550
Yuan!

829
40:22.340 --> 40:23.090
Shize.

830
40:24.090 --> 40:25.480
Just let me go.

831
40:25.530 --> 40:26.110
Yuan!

832
40:35.730 --> 40:36.980
Yuan!

833
40:55.300 --> 40:56.090
Sorry.

834
40:57.180 --> 40:58.000
I'm fine.

835
40:58.000 --> 41:00.110
Did... Did you have a nightmare?

836
41:00.110 --> 41:01.400
You don't look so good.

837
41:10.760 --> 41:11.550
Are you okay?

838
41:11.550 --> 41:12.360
I'm fine.

839
41:13.590 --> 41:14.520
It doesn't hurt.

840
41:25.440 --> 41:26.000
Hello?

841
41:31.340 --> 41:31.980
What?

842
41:34.550 --> 41:35.190
Okay.

843
41:37.590 --> 41:39.050
Is something urgent?

844
41:40.550 --> 41:42.090
Someone in my family is sick.

845
41:42.090 --> 41:43.320
I need to get to the hospital.

846
41:43.320 --> 41:44.180
Go right ahead.

847
41:44.500 --> 41:45.800
I can go back by myself.

848
41:47.360 --> 41:48.290
I'm really fine.

849
41:49.960 --> 41:50.760
Sorry.

850
41:50.760 --> 41:51.760
asiankh.org
